# Root-level ignore for `vercel deploy` run from the monorepo root.
# This repo's root deploys build apps/tolom only (project Root Directory =
# apps/tolom), so sibling apps' sources are excluded from uploads.
# Workspace members' package.json files are kept so `pnpm install` at the
# root can resolve every project in pnpm-lock.yaml.

# --- Heavy / generated (also gitignored, kept here for the tgz archive path) ---
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.turbo
**/logs
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*

# --- Sibling apps: keep only their package.json for workspace resolution ---
# Root deploys serve apps/tolom and apps/agent-gateway — their sources are
# uploaded. Vercel's ignore does not support re-inclusion under a
# directory-wide exclusion, so sibling apps are excluded by name.
!apps/
apps/archive/
apps/docs/
apps/khosuud/
apps/onoo/
apps/onoo-app/
apps/sakhuu/
apps/side/
apps/sms-pay/
apps/tamga/
apps/tamga-web/
apps/tolom-mobile/
apps/tumurch/
apps/tumurch-rn/
apps/website/
apps/zatly/
apps/zer/
apps/zer-app/
apps/zerbu/
apps/zill/
apps/zim/
apps/zoa/
apps/zraf/
apps/zraf-web/
apps/zuiio-id/
apps/zunch/
!apps/*/package.json
